  "description": "Titan by Khadlaj is a bold, structured, and powerful fragrance crafted for those who enjoy strong modern masculines with a warm amber-woody foundation. It opens with fresh spices and citrus energy, giving a confident first spray that grabs attention instantly. The heart introduces clean woods, resinous warmth, and a refined aromatic touch that keeps it smooth instead of sharp. The base dries into rich amber, dark woods, and long-lasting musk—delivering excellent endurance and masculine presence on skin and clothes. This scent fits customers who want a strong, warm, slightly spiced, clean-woody signature that performs all day and stands strong at night.",
